AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:CHEBI_17303 "Morphine")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CHEBI_17303 "A morphinane alkaloid that is a highly potent opiate analgesic psychoactive drug. Morphine acts directly on the central nervous system (CNS) to relieve pain but has a high potential for addiction, with tolerance and both physical and psychological dependence developing rapidly. Morphine is the most abundant opiate found in Papaver somniferum (the opium poppy).")
