AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000450 "The use of 'initiates' is intended to convey that a pathogenic disposition is realized when processes resulting in a disorder begin because of some action on the part of the bearer of the disposition.  By this interpretation of 'initiates', disorder-causing entities such as glass, UV light, and toxins do not have a pathogenic disposition.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000450 "Albert Goldfain")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000412 obo:IDO_0000450 obo:ido.owl)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:IDO_0000450 "A pathogenic disposition is realized in processes that create a disorder.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:IDO_0000450 "Lindsay Cowell")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000118 obo:IDO_0000450 "pathogenicity"@en)
