AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:NCIT_C5226 "A low grade serous epithelial neoplasm arising from the ovary.  It is characterized by an atypical proliferation of serous-type epithelial cells without evidence of stromal invasion.  It is often asymptomatic but rarely it may present with abdominal pain or abdominal enlargement due to rupture or torsion.")
