AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:OBIB_0000634 "Mathias Brochhausen")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:OBIB_0000634 "MB: This class should probably be a subclass to CRID. However, the textual definition of CRID right now states that each instance has the CRID identifier as a part. This is not the case for telephone numbers. Therefore, they cannot be subsumed under CRID now. I am looking into changing IAO accordingly. Once that is done, the class ought to be a subclass of CRID."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:OBIB_0000634 "telephone number"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OBIB_0000634 "A telephone number  is a textual entity consisting of a sequence of digits used to call from one telephone line to another in a public switched telephone network."@en)
