Declaration(Class(obo:OBI_0000339))
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OBI_0000339 "a process of creating or modifying a plan specification"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:OBI_0000339 "Bjoern Peters")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000412 obo:OBI_0000339 obo:obi.owl)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:OBI_0000339 "7/18/2011 BP: planning used to itself be a planned process. Barry Smith pointed out that this would lead to an infinite regression, as there would have to be a plan to conduct a planning process, which in itself would be the result of planning etc. Therefore, the restrictions on 'planning' were loosened to allow for informal processes that result in an 'ad hoc plan '. This required changing from 'has_specified_output some plan specifiction' to 'has_participant some plan specification'.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000111 obo:OBI_0000339 "planning")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:OBI_0000339 "Plans and Planned Processes Branch")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:OBI_0000339 "planning"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000112 obo:OBI_0000339 "The process of a scientist thinking about and deciding what reagents to use as part of a protocol for an experiment. Note that the scientist could be human or a \"robot scientist\" executing software.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:OBI_0000339 "Bjoern Peters")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:OBI_0000339 obo:IAO_0000122)
