AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000116 obo:OBI_0000852 "This class should probably end up in IAO. It could be further breaken down to indicate different kinds of lack of knowledge, e.g. inability to determine something vs. no attempt made to determine something vs. no informatino available if it was even attempted to determine something. The design pattern should be generalizable. 'unknown sex' is the first example, and needed immediately.")
