Declaration(Class(obo:OBI_0001064))
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000111 obo:OBI_0001064 "automatic tissue processor")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000114 obo:OBI_0001064 obo:IAO_0000120)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:OBI_0001064 "PERSON: Erik Segerdell")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OBI_0001064 "A device for processing histological tissue having a tissue carrier basket suspended from a turntable overlying a plurality of beakers suspended from a carrier plate. The turntable is raised, indexed, and lowered by a suitable driving mechanism to move the tissue basket sequentially through the beakers. Timers can each be programmed to control the movement of the turntable to provide various different cycles for processing the tissue. Some of the beakers are received in individual thermal baths to heat and control the temperature of the substances received in the beakers for treating the tissue.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:OBI_0001064 "United States Patent 3762362")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000412 obo:OBI_0001064 obo:obi.owl)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:OBI_0001064 "automatic tissue processor")
