AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000112 obo:OBI_0500027 "PMID: 23979341-The major inclusion criterion was patients in whom severe cerebral embolism was diagnosed at age 75 or younger (more than 9 in the NIHSS score on day 7 after the onset of stroke) ."@en)
