Declaration(Class(obo:OMRSE_00000204))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:OMRSE_00000204 "social identity information content entity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000412 obo:OMRSE_00000204 obo:omrse.owl)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000204 "William R. Hogan"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OMRSE_00000204 "An information content entity that is intended to be a truthful statement about some person and whether that person identifies as some particular aspect of social identity—such as a gender, an ethnicity, a race, or a sexual orientation—where the sense of identifying may correspond to either (i) an aspect of one’s cognitive representation of oneself, (ii) how one prefers to be regarded by others within some social context, or (iii) how one chooses to present oneself to others within some social context."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000204 "Mathias Brochhausen"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000204 "Amanda Hicks"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:OMRSE_00000204 "S. Clint Dowland"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000204 "Sarah Bost"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000204 "Matthew Diller"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:OMRSE_00000204 "We include (i)-(iii) to acknowledge that there are different senses of \"identify\" that are relevant here, and that we may not always be sure which sense the person concretizing the social identity information content entity intended. While (i) concerns how one thinks of oneself, (ii) and (iii) are more focused on one's interactions with others. Importantly, some choose not to share with others how they identify in the sense of (i). For example, one can consider oneself to be some certain gender without either wanting others to know or choosing to present oneself in a corresponding way. We distinguish (ii) and (iii) because one can prefer to be regarded some certain way without attempting to present oneself in any corresponding way."@en)
SubClassOf(obo:OMRSE_00000204 obo:IAO_0000030)
Declaration(Class(obo:OMRSE_00000205))
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:OMRSE_00000205 "S. Clint Dowland"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:OMRSE_00000205 "Ethnicity is separate from but related to racial identity. It refers more to identifying with a particular culture than with individuals similar in physical appearance. It includes things like Hispanic ethnicity (which spans many nations) and national cultural identities like Irish and ethnic groups within nations such as Catalan and Armenian."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000205 "Sarah Bost"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000205 "Amanda Hicks"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000205 "Mathias Brochhausen"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000205 "Matthew Diller"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OMRSE_00000205 "A social identity information content entity that is about whether some person identifies as some ethnicity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000205 "William R. Hogan"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:OMRSE_00000205 "ethnic identity information content entity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000412 obo:OMRSE_00000205 obo:omrse.owl)
SubClassOf(obo:OMRSE_00000205 obo:OMRSE_00000204)
Declaration(Class(obo:OMRSE_00000206))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:OMRSE_00000206 "OMB ethnic identity information content entity"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000412 obo:OMRSE_00000206 obo:omrse.owl)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:OMRSE_00000206 "An ethnic identity information content entity that uses OMB terminology for ethnicity or terminology that is strictly mapped onto the OMB ethnicity terms."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000206 "Amanda Hicks"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:OMRSE_00000206 "OMB dichotomizes ethnicity into Hispanic or Latino and Not Hispanic or Latino, and ignores all other forms of ethnicity."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:OMRSE_00000206 "S. Clint Dowland"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000206 "William R. Hogan"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000206 "Matthew Diller"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000206 "Sarah Bost"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:OMRSE_00000206 "Mathias Brochhausen"@en)
