AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:OMRSE_00000215 "This definition corresponds to that used by OMB. It is worth noting that the OMB definition from which this one is derived is problematic, in that it implies that one's race cannot be Native American or Alaskan Native unless one maintains tribal affiliations or community attachment."@en)
