AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:GEO_000000329 "A governing organization G1 is subordinate to another governing organization G2 iff there is some authority possessed by G2 that is not possessed by G1 and G1's jurisdiction falls within the relevant jurisdiction of G2."@en)
