AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000232 obo:OBI_0000417 "modified according to email thread from 1/23/09 in accordince with DT and PPPB branch")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000112 obo:OBI_0000417 "A cell sorting process achieves the objective specification 'material separation objective'")
